Believe me, I know. I went through a period of savescumming. It is
of course easier to arrange under Windows, where you don't generally
have to worry about permissions and sudo and so forth. But it
amounts to the same thing.

I didn't ascend while I was savescumming. I never even made it to
the castle.  Eventually I started looking for other ways to cheat
... and eventually I realized there wasn't any real point. I was
only wasting my own time.

Go ahead, savescum. I predict that you will find it greatly
encouraging ... for a while. Then the game will start getting
boring. Then you'll stop playing altogether.  You may return to it
after some weeks, or months, or years. And you'll think carefully
about whether you want to continue savescumming.


